      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The article deals with the following trends along which according to the author, investigations aimed at search for ways of correcting disturbed metabolic processes in the cardiac muscle in its incompetence should develop: 1) restoration of properties of contractile proteins and creation of a basis for successful formation of the processes of compensatory hyperfunction and hypertrophy of the myocardium; 2) correction of the electrolytic balance with regulation of the skin mechanisms of the process of contraction of myofibrils; 3) restoration of the energy potential of cells; 4) withdrawal of the damaging effect upon the myocardium of some products of its disturbed metabolism."},
